      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.83,
      365.23,
      455.9,
      403.1
    ],
    "text": "Clause 3: This clause amends section 71 of the principal enactment and the legaleffect as amended is to empower the Minister to make regulations in order to give effectto the Convention on International Trade in Endangered Species of Wild Fauna and Flora(CITES).",
