    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      168.43,
      203.69,
      397.19,
      267.47
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(fb) the appointment of ad-hoc committees, for thepurpose of obtaining their recommendations on anypermit to be issued under the Convention onInternational Trade in Endangered Species of WildFauna and Flora (CITES);\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      278.45,
      450.44,
      318.62
    ],
    "text": "4.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.Sinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency",
